<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Those with the ability to change their own fate are to be feared and respected; destroy them, follow behind them, or fall before them.-->
  <TM_Transcendent.description>那些有能力改变自己命运的人应该受到敬畏和尊重；摧毁他们，跟随他们，或者在他们面前倒下。</TM_Transcendent.description>
  <TM_Transcendent.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: creation(tag=meme_TM_Transcendent)           ->Drifting in an eternity of magic, [deity0_name] gazed upon the physical worlds and saw anguish and strife, where the few used the power of machines and archotech to prey upon the many. Wishing to restore balance, [deity0_name] weaved threads of [deity0_possessive] power into the essence of all humankind, granting them the ability to touch and the will to use magic.-->
    <li>creation(tag=meme_TM_Transcendent)           -&gt;在永恒的魔法中漂流，[deity0_name]凝视着物质世界，看到了痛苦和冲突，在那里，少数人利用机器和超凡科技的力量掠夺多数人。希望恢复平衡，[deity0_name]将[deity0_possessive]的力量编织成线融入全人类的本质，并赋予他们触摸和使用魔法的能力。</li>
    <!--EN: episode(uses=1,tag=meme_TM_Transcendent)     ->Magic, granted to good and evil alike, was used uncaringly and threatened to sunder the earth, causing pain and chaos to all. [deity0_name], seeing that humankind did not yet have the maturity for self-control, reduced the flow of mana to a trickle, striking the knowledge of its use from the minds of its weilders. Thus, magic became a rarity, where its use was requisite upon the dedication and energy of its stewards.-->
    <li>episode(uses=1,tag=meme_TM_Transcendent)     -&gt;魔术被授予善与恶，被无处不在，威胁要晒太阳，造成所有人的痛苦和混乱。[deity0_name]，看到人类尚未具有自我控制的成熟度，将法力的流动减少到了trick流，从而从其魏尔德人的思想中引起了人们对其使用的了解。因此，魔术变得很稀有，它的使用是在其管家的奉献精神和能量上所必需的。</li>
    <!--EN: intro(tag=meme_TM_Transcendent)              ->At the [place_summary] [place_name], the ritual of true birth began at the [diety0_type] [altarRoomLabel] of [deity0_name] where the terrified yet desperate [founderName] reached out with intensity and ferver to create a path through sheer strength of will. [diety0_name], witnessing this unfathomable strength of spirit, bestowed upon [founderName] a connection to magic.-->
    <li>intro(tag=meme_TM_Transcendent)              -&gt;在 [place_summary] [place_name]，真正的诞生仪式在 [deity0_name] 的 [diety0_type] [altarRoomLabel] 开始，在那里，惊恐而又绝望的 [FounderName] 以强烈和热情伸出援手，通过纯粹的意志力创造了一条道路 。 [diety0_name]见证了这种深不可测的精神力量，赋予了[FounderName]与魔法的联系。</li>
    <!--EN: conflict(tag=meme_TM_Transcendent)           ->A violent [foeLeader] tried to seize this power, killing many to reach [place_name].-->
    <li>conflict(tag=meme_TM_Transcendent)           -&gt;一个暴力的[foeleader]试图抓住这种力量，杀死了许多人到达[placeName]。</li>
    <!--EN: founderJoin(tag=meme_TM_Transcendent)        ->[deity0_name] commanded [founderName] to learn the ways of magic and defend [founder_possessive] tribe. [founderName] spent every waking hour communing with [deity0_name] at [altarRoomLabel].-->
    <li>founderJoin(tag=meme_TM_Transcendent)        -&gt;[deity0_name]命令[foundername]学习魔术和捍卫[funder_possessive]部落的方式。[foundername]在[partarroomlabel]上度过了每个醒着的小时与[deity0_name]交流。</li>
    <!--EN: victory(tag=meme_TM_Transcendent)            ->Consumed by an ocean of malice, [foeLeader] marched [foeLeader_possessive] armies upon [place_name] to kill [founderName]. Yet, on the day of reckoning, [founderName] emerged from [founder_possessive] communion with [diety0_name] and called forth a storm of [TM_stormType] and [TM_stormType], utterly destroying the armies of [foeLeader]. Thus, the bloodline of magic took hold and began to spread its roots throughout [place_summary].-->
    <li>victory(tag=meme_TM_Transcendent)            -&gt;[foeleader]被恶意的海洋吞噬了，将[foeleader_possessive]军队进军[place_name]杀死[fundername]。然而，在估算的那天，[foundername]从[founder_possessive]与[diety0_name]的交流中出现，并召集了[tm_stormtype]和[tm_stormtype]的风暴，完全破坏了[foeleader]的军队。因此，魔术的血统占据了，并开始在整个[place_summary]中散布其根源。</li>
    <!--EN: setup(tag=meme_TM_Transcendent)              ->[founderName] fought in many battles for his urbworld overlords, seeing much grief, dispare, and death. Exhausted from the senselessness, [founder_pronoun] threw away his weapons and vowed to [diety0_name] to shape [founder_possessive] future in the pursuit of peace and prosperity instead of violence.-->
    <li>setup(tag=meme_TM_Transcendent)              -&gt;[Foundername]为他的Urbworld霸主而战，看到了很多悲伤，分发和死亡。[funder_pronoun]筋疲力尽，扔掉了他的武器，誓言[diety0_name]以塑造[funder_possessive]的未来，以追求和平与繁荣而不是暴力。</li>
    <!--EN: story(uses=1,tag=meme_TM_Transcendent)       ->[founderName] preached the peaceful way as the true way to eternal life and was granted powerful [diety0_type] magic from his patron diety [diety0_name].-->
    <li>story(uses=1,tag=meme_TM_Transcendent)       -&gt;[foundername]宣讲和平的方式是永恒生活的真实方式，并从他的赞助人的宠儿中获得了强大的[diety0_type]魔术[diety0_name]。</li>
    <!--EN: lessonIntro(tag=meme_TM_Transcendent)         ->In order to empower ourselves, we must first give up the technologies and contraptions that stunt our growth. Only then can the struggle to survive change us.-->
    <li>lessonIntro(tag=meme_TM_Transcendent)         -&gt;为了赋予自己能力，我们必须首先放弃阻碍我们成长的技术和装置。只有这样，为生存而奋斗才能改变我们。</li>
    <!--EN: lesson(tag=meme_TM_Transcendent)              ->We grow and adapt by overcoming challenges.-->
    <li>lesson(tag=meme_TM_Transcendent)              -&gt;我们通过克服挑战而成长和适应。</li>
    <!--EN: lessonReinforcement(tag=meme_TM_Transcendent) ->In order to attain true power, we must give up the objects that provide stability and allow us to remain weak.-->
    <li>lessonReinforcement(tag=meme_TM_Transcendent) -&gt;为了获得真正的力量，我们必须放弃提供稳定性并使我们保持弱的对象。</li>
    <!--EN: archistBasis(tag=meme_TM_Transcendent)       ->When the archotechs appeared they were never concerned for appearances; they showed us that the mind stands above the physical form.-->
    <li>archistBasis(tag=meme_TM_Transcendent)       -&gt;当Archotech出现时，他们从不关心外表。他们向我们展示了思维高于物理形式。</li>
    <!--EN: archistFact(tag=meme_TM_Transcendent)        ->Archotechs did not foresee the seed of magic within humankind and their instructions to achieve enlightenment took an unforseen turn.-->
    <li>archistFact(tag=meme_TM_Transcendent)        -&gt;Archotechs并没有预见到人类内的魔法种子，他们实现启蒙运动的指示经历了一个不可预见的转变。</li>
    <!--EN: archistProphecy(tag=meme_TM_Transcendent)    ->[inTheEnd], humankind was able to achieve a new form of enlightenment through the revelation and connection to magic.-->
    <li>archistProphecy(tag=meme_TM_Transcendent)    -&gt;[在Theeend]，人类能够通过启示和与魔术的联系来实现一种新的启蒙形式。</li>
    <!--EN: animistFact(tag=meme_TM_Transcendent)        ->The spirit realm draws ever closer with the permeation of magic; the veil of spirits can be parted momentarily for those strong in magic, and even crossed if the price is paid.-->
    <li>animistFact(tag=meme_TM_Transcendent)        -&gt;精神领域随着魔术的渗透而越来越近。精神的面纱可以为那些魔术强大的人暂时分开，甚至付出了价格。</li>
  </TM_Transcendent.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings>
